<title>INDIA: India's Dabur 96/97 net 414.2 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>India's Dabur 96/97 net 414.2 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    414.2  vs   343.3</p>
<p>    Net sales	   7,070.0  vs 5,610.0</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)	14.53 vs    12.04</p>
<p>    Div (pct)		30.0  vs    30.0</p>
<p>    Exports		 915.3  vs   690.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Dabur India Ltd is a leading healthcare company which announced its results after a board meeting on Wednesday</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
